<title>USA: Falconbridge sets $250 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Falconbridge sets $250 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Falconbridge Ltd was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER FALCONBRIDGE LTD</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	  COUPON 7.35 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES     ISS PRICE 99.859  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2     YIELD 7.37 PCT    PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS   SPREAD +79 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-U.S. corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
